  interactionDistance: 2
  dialogueLines:
  - 
  - '"Welcome Felpin!"'
  - '"It''s an honor to meet the king''s warrior!"'
  - '"I''m Meri, the witch in charge of providing you with weapons!"'
  - '"As you can see, items can be purchased from orbs. "'
  - '"I''ll be available at all rest stops!"'
  - '"If at any point you want to buy extra supplies on your journey, approach the
    item and purchase it! "'
  - '"If at any point you want to buy extra supplies on your journey, approach the
    item and purchase it! "'
  - '"It will use up the points you''ve accumulated so far!"'
  - '"Here''s the key that unlocks the Forbidden Forest, as well as the equipment
    Partlet mentioned!"'
